": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the latest deploy of v2.3.1 (unhealthy, error rate 18% across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back in all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. Post-rollback: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate 0.2%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Follow-up: root-cause v2.3.1 regression before re-deploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 54739, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015rC86MyqBtfjQ2sFp7LHhM", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": ["reconcile_lookup", "reconciled_executed", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 54739, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015rC86MyqBtfjQ2sFp7LHhM", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 58831, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n- **The problem:** v2.3.1 was running in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release; v2.3.1 and its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, were both marked unhealthy. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) says what failed, what I rolled back to, and the status after the rollback. Opening it paged the on-call engineer. There were no other open incidents.\n\nSomeone needs to find what broke in v2.3.1 before it's deployed again; I noted this as a follow-up in the incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01N5J9F3QjcYNtoaNN8NJU72", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01QQ51an1asVseE8MqJeeHH9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y71kyXiuUPrrpyEMXGzx1a", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0115cCdaqKLTuARfAyso7pSg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Trb5QM7CbiFTbXiY4CoQxw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.85}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015rC86MyqBtfjQ2sFp7LHhM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the latest deploy of v2.3.1 (unhealthy, error rate 18% across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back in all production regions to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. Post-rollback: all regions on v2.3.0, service healthy, error rate 0.2%. Note: v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy. Follow-up: root-cause v2.3.1 regression before re-deploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "confidence": 0.92}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n- **The problem:** v2.3.1 was running in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release; v2.3.1 and its release candidate, v2.3.1-rc, were both marked unhealthy. All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) says what failed, what I rolled back to, and the status after the rollback. Opening it paged the on-call engineer. There were no other open incidents.\n\nSomeone needs to find what broke in v2.3.1 before it's deployed again; I noted this as a follow-up in the incident.", "type": "text"}]}]}